    "岗位差距是主要排序依据；AI 加速情景会提高 AI、数据与编程相关技能的演示权重。趋势映射和岗位模板等级为产品演示配置；自定义岗位要求由用户输入，WEF 报告没有给出这些具体岗位等级。预计周数 = 路径任务估算小时 ÷ 每周可投入小时并向上取整。该估算不保证学习结果。": "Role skill gaps are the main ordering criterion. The accelerated-AI scenario increases the demo weighting of AI, data, and programming skills. Trend mappings and template levels are demo configurations; custom requirements are entered by the user. The WEF report does not specify these role levels. Estimated weeks equal estimated task hours divided by weekly available hours, rounded up. This estimate does not guarantee learning outcomes.",
    "查看能力档案": "View skills profile",
    "添加": "Add",
    "先选择一项或多项能力": "Select one or more skills first",
    "可按类别勾选；完成评估后结果会逐项进入能力档案。": "Select skills by category. Completed assessment results are added to your profile for each skill.",
    "这是职业发展用途的初步筛查，不是已验证的心理测量、行业认证或就业承诺。可在档案中修改、补证或删除。": "This is preliminary screening for career development, not a validated psychometric test, industry certification, or employment promise. Edit, supplement, or delete results in your profile.",
