    "预计 7–9 分钟。选项顺序已随机调整，本次作答期间保持稳定。本版只有通用工作情境题，尚无该能力专项题，因此不能单独判断该专业技能水平。题目为 {version} 版初稿，尚未经专家或心理测量验证；结果仅作低可信初步参考，建议补交任务或作品证据。粗略等级映射（未校准）：题目覆盖不足 60% 不给等级；覆盖达标后，答对率低于 40% / 40–59% / 60–79% / 至少 80% 映射为 1 / 2 / 3 / 4 级。": "Estimated time: 7–9 minutes. Answer options are shuffled and stay fixed during this attempt. This version contains only general workplace-scenario questions and cannot assess skill-specific proficiency on its own. Version: {version}. Questions have not been reviewed by experts or psychometrically validated. Results are low-confidence preliminary guidance; add work samples or task evidence. Uncalibrated level mapping: no level below 60% question coverage. With sufficient coverage, accuracy below 40% / 40–59% / 60–79% / at least 80% maps to levels 1 / 2 / 3 / 4.",
